},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ。めっちゃ嬉しいですよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達も何気なく踊ってくれたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌ってくれたりするけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心の中でにやけちゃってるよ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ！見たい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テスト前やったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログの更新率減るん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問回答もそんなに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"できないかもしれないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勉強がんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校は、45分授業？50分授業？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本50分みっちり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46入ってから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達からの見る目変わりましたか??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達は普通に接してくれるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく応援してくれて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サポートもしてくれて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな優しいんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイドが似合うと思うんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋葉原はよく行くのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またコスプレってしたいのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイドとかロリータファッションが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似合いそうとよく言われる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"童顔だからだねっっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういうわけでもないのか笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コスプレもあんまりしないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋葉原もあまり行きません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一度は着てみたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コテコテにメイクして着てみたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がうっちの正しい使い方教えてー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がうっちは噛みついちゃうぞ的な"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感じですが、意味もなくブログで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"使っちゃうこともあります笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自由に使ってね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がうっっっち"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝る前に必ずやることってある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝れないとき何を考えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝ようとしますか？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝る前にボーッとする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マッサージ、ストレッチ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"横になって考え事してたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつの間にか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眠くなってくるよー^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ｾﾝﾁﾒﾝﾀﾙってどゆ意味なの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙もろい。切なくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心がゆらゆらしてる感じ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"センチメンタルな秋がきたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/