g/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢のひとつですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おらおらおらー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤さまのお通りだー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"想像してごらん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし、ねねがまりかの顔で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかがねねの顔だったら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねね「想像しただけで寒気が..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私...ただの幼稚園児になっちゃう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...ぶるっ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか「...ぶるっ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度一緒に料理すること"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"約束したんだーいいでしょー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/6377012/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私だって作れるもーん←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では明日もレッスン頑張りまりか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito